      "body": "<style>\n.rg{box-sizing:border-box;max-width:1040px;margin:0 auto;font-family:var(--ow-font);color:var(--ow-fg)}\n.rg *{box-sizing:border-box}\n.rg svg{display:block;width:100%;max-width:760px;height:auto;margin:0 auto}\n.rg svg text{font-family:var(--ow-font);fill:var(--ow-fg)}\n.rg .lbl{font-size:14px;fill:var(--ow-muted)}\n.rg .st{font-size:17px;font-weight:700}\n.rg .tall{display:none}\n.rg-list{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;gap:10px}\n.rg-list li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto auto auto;justify-content:start;align-items:center;gap:6px 8px}\n.rg-list b{color:var(--ow-muted);font-size:16px}\n.rg-list em{grid-column:1/-1;font-style:normal;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ow-muted);margin-top:-2px}\n.rg .p{display:inline-block;padding:4px 12px;border-radius:999px;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;border:2px solid var(--ow-line);background:var(--ow-panel)}\n.rg .p.c{border:2px dashed var(--ow-accent)}\n.rg .p.l{background:var(--ow-accent);border-color:var(--ow-accent);color:var(--ow-accent-ink)}\n@media (max-width:600px){.rg .wide{display:none}.rg .tall{display:grid}}\n.rg-h{margin:22px 0 10px;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:650;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ow-muted)}\n.rg-terms{display:flex;gap:4px;align-items:stretch}\n.rg-t{flex:var(--w);min-width:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px}\n.rg-bar{display:flex;height:22px;border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden}\n.rg-bar i{display:block;height:100%}\n.rg-bar .e{flex:1;background:var(--ow-accent)}\n.rg-bar .n{flex:var(--n);background:color-mix(in oklch,var(--ow-accent) 28%,var(--ow-panel))}\n.rg-t span{font-size:13px;font-weight:650}\n.rg-t small{font-size:12px;color:var(--ow-muted);line-height:1.3}\n.rg-key{display:flex;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:10px;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ow-muted)}\n.rg-key i{display:inline-block;width:14px;height:10px;border-radius:3px;margin-right:6px;vertical-align:-1px}\n</style>\n<div class=\"rg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Raft's three server states and the events that move a server between them, and a timeline of terms, each starting with an election\">\n  <svg class=\"wide\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 300\">\n    <defs><marker id=\"rgA\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"var(--ow-muted)\"/></marker></defs>\n    <g fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--ow-muted)\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#rgA)\">\n      <path d=\"M8 135H58\"/>\n      <path d=\"M172 125H306\"/>\n      <path d=\"M454 125H588\"/>\n      <path d=\"M352 100C335 30 425 30 408 100\"/>\n      <path d=\"M330 154C300 182 200 182 160 160\"/>\n      <path d=\"M640 160C600 290 170 290 125 166\"/>\n    </g>\n    <text class=\"lbl\" x=\"2\" y=\"122\">starts</text>\n    <text class=\"lbl\" x=\"239\" y=\"94\" text-anchor=\"middle\">no heartbeat:</text>\n    <text class=\"lbl\" x=\"239\" y=\"112\" text-anchor=\"middle\">times out,</text>\n    <text class=\"lbl\" x=\"239\" y=\"146\" text-anchor=\"middle\">starts election</text>\n    <text class=\"lbl\" x=\"521\" y=\"114\" text-anchor=\"middle\">wins votes</text>\n    <text class=\"lbl\" x=\"521\" y=\"146\" text-anchor=\"middle\">from a majority</text>\n    <text class=\"lbl\" x=\"380\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"middle\">times out again: new term, new election</text>\n    <text class=\"lbl\" x=\"285\" y=\"205\" text-anchor=\"middle\">hears a leader or a higher term</text>\n    <text class=\"lbl\" x=\"380\" y=\"294\" text-anchor=\"middle\">hears a higher term: steps down</text>\n    <rect x=\"62\" y=\"100\" width=\"108\" height=\"56\" rx=\"28\" fill=\"var(--ow-panel)\" stroke=\"var(--ow-line)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n    <text class=\"st\" x=\"116\" y=\"134\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Follower</text>\n    <rect x=\"310\" y=\"100\" width=\"140\" height=\"56\" rx=\"28\" fill=\"var(--ow-panel)\" stroke=\"var(--ow-accent)\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 4\"/>\n    <text class=\"st\" x=\"380\" y=\"134\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Candidate</text>\n    <rect x=\"592\" y=\"100\" width=\"120\" height=\"56\" rx=\"28\" fill=\"var(--ow-accent)\"/>\n    <text class=\"st\" x=\"652\" y=\"134\" text-anchor=\"middle\" style=\"fill:var(--ow-accent-ink)\">Leader</text>\n  </svg>\n  <ul class=\"tall rg-list\">\n    <li><span class=\"p f\">Follower</span><b>&rarr;</b><span class=\"p c\">Candidate</span><em>times out with no heartbeat, starts an election</em></li>\n    <li><span class=\"p c\">Candidate</span><b>&rarr;</b><span class=\"p l\">Leader</span><em>wins votes from a majority</em></li>\n    <li><span class=\"p c\">Candidate</span><b>&#8635;</b><span class=\"p c\">Candidate</span><em>times out again: new term, new election</em></li>\n    <li><span class=\"p c\">Candidate</span><b>&rarr;</b><span class=\"p f\">Follower</span><em>hears a leader or a higher term</em></li>\n    <li><span class=\"p l\">Leader</span><b>&rarr;</b><span class=\"p f\">Follower</span><em>hears a higher term: steps down</em></li>\n  </ul>\n  <p class=\"rg-h\">Time is cut into terms; each starts with an election</p>\n  <div class=\"rg-terms\">\n    <div class=\"rg-t\" style=\"--w:5\"><div class=\"rg-bar\" style=\"--n:6\"><i class=\"e\"></i><i class=\"n\"></i></div><span>term 1</span><small>S2 leads</small></div>\n    <div class=\"rg-t\" style=\"--w:3\"><div class=\"rg-bar\" style=\"--n:3\"><i class=\"e\"></i><i class=\"n\"></i></div><span>term 2</span><small>S2 crashes; S4 leads</small></div>\n    <div class=\"rg-t\" style=\"--w:2\"><div class=\"rg-bar\" style=\"--n:0\"><i class=\"e\"></i></div><span>term 3</span><small>split vote</small></div>\n    <div class=\"rg-t\" style=\"--w:4\"><div class=\"rg-bar\" style=\"--n:5\"><i class=\"e\"></i><i class=\"n\"></i></div><span>term 4</span><small>S1 leads</small></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"rg-key\"><span><i style=\"background:var(--ow-accent)\"></i>election</span><span><i style=\"background:color-mix(in oklch,var(--ow-accent) 28%,var(--ow-panel))\"></i>normal operation under one leader</span></div>\n</div>"
